  "releaseNotes": "v2.4.5 Workflow Simplification & Reliability: Simplified GitHub Actions to single reliable release workflow after consolidation issues. Enhanced CORS configuration with dynamic production domain support. Fixed critical /api/EAuth path handling for production deployments. Maintained dual .NET 8/9 targeting with simplified build process. Focused on core functionality and reliability over complex features.",
